    <!-- About Us Section -->
    <section class="about-section text-center">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title"><strong>About Us</strong></h2>
            <p class="lead">Empowering students with a seamless Integrated Placement Test and Chatbot System for career success.</p>
            <p>Our platform is designed to streamline the process of conducting, managing, and analyzing placement tests. We bridge the gap between students and companies, offering a structured way to assess skills efficiently. This system helps academic institutions create customized placement tests and track student performance across various areas such as aptitude, technical knowledge, logical reasoning, and soft skills.</p>
            <p>We aim to equip students with the tools they need to succeed in their job placements and enable recruiters to find the best candidates for their organizations. Our platform is built with the goal of enhancing communication between students, recruiters, and placement officers, creating a streamlined and efficient recruitment process.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <br>
    <!-- Key Benefits Section -->
    <section class="benefits-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h3 class="text-center mb-4">Key Benefits</h3>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Automated Test Management</h5>
                        <p>Conduct online tests effortlessly with real-time analytics and AI-based evaluations. The system automates everything from scheduling to result generation, minimizing manual errors and optimizing time for both students and recruiters.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Customizable Test Modules</h5>
                        <p>Create tailored tests to evaluate specific skill sets required by recruiters. Whether you're looking for technical, aptitude, or soft skills, our platform allows for flexible test creation to suit the needs of different industries.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Smart Interview Chatbot</h5>
                        <p>Students can interact with an AI-powered chatbot to access interview questions added by the admin or scraped from platforms like GeeksforGeeks. It allows company-specific searches, answer practice, and maintains search history for effective preparation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Comprehensive Analytics</h5>
                        <p>Our platform provides detailed performance analytics, offering insights into students' strengths and areas for improvement. This helps recruiters make data-driven decisions and assists students in identifying areas to focus on for their future growth.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 offset-md-2">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Seamless Integration</h5>
                        <p>The platform seamlessly integrates with university or institution management systems, allowing easy importing of student data, managing schedules, and automating report generation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Secure and Reliable</h5>
                        <p>Our platform ensures data security with encrypted storage and authentication features, making it safe for users to store personal information and test results with confidence.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 offset-md-2">
                    <div class="benefit-box p-4 text-center shadow">
                        <h5>Multi-Device Compatibility</h5>
                        <p>Access the platform seamlessly from desktops, tablets, and mobile devices for maximum flexibility.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

